%% Figure 3.X — SOC Alert Queue State Machine
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> ML_DETECTED : ML Pipeline Output

    ML_DETECTED --> PENDING_ADMIN_ACTION : Alert Queued\nID: ALT-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS-NNNN

    PENDING_ADMIN_ACTION --> ADMIN_BLOCK : Admin POST\n/soc/alerts/{id}/resolve\naction=BLOCK
    PENDING_ADMIN_ACTION --> ADMIN_ALLOW : action=ALLOW
    PENDING_ADMIN_ACTION --> ADMIN_IGNORE : action=IGNORE
    PENDING_ADMIN_ACTION --> ENFORCED_BLOCK : Fingerprint Auto-Match\n(O(1) lookup)

    ADMIN_BLOCK --> ENFORCED_BLOCK : Fingerprint → _blocked_set\nOverride index updated

    ENFORCED_BLOCK --> RESET : POST /soc/alerts/reset/{id}\n(Demo/Testing)

    ADMIN_ALLOW --> [*] : Request Forwarded
    ADMIN_IGNORE --> [*] : Request Forwarded
    RESET --> [*] : Fingerprint + Override Cleared

    note right of PENDING_ADMIN_ACTION
        Human-in-the-Loop\nDecision Point\n\nStorage: deque(1000)\nPersistence: JSON file\nDedup: fingerprint index
    end note

    note right of ENFORCED_BLOCK
        Future matching requests\nblocked at middleware\nBEFORE ML pipeline\n\nLatency: <0.1ms
    end note
